{"synopsis":"> [!warning]\n> **<Despair that reach the skies>** \n> **<Gloom trapped in a swamp>**\n> **<One Who Couldnt be Born>**  \n> **<Foolish Calamity>**\n\n\n\nHanya  dengan menatap mereka saja manusia biasa bisa kehilangan nyawa mereka Mereka membuat dunia jatuh dalam kegelapan.\n\nsetelah puluhan tahun bertarung survivor terakhir mendapatkan kesimpulan \n\n> \"Inner takkan bisa mengalahkan Outer\"\n\nPada Saat itu `Chronos`  yang bisa memanipulasi waktu mengorbankan dirinya untuk memutarbalikkan waktu\n\n> Jika Begini kita takkan bisa menang. Kembali ke time line dunia lama!\n\nManusia yang dipilih oleh semua `Inner Gods` untuk kembali ke masa lalu, manusia terakhir yang bisa mendaki Tower dan manusia yang juga dapat bertarung dengan dewa hinggal akhir, dialah\n\n> Kim Yuwon","alternative_title":"LWG, 신과 함께 레벨업","author":"Black Ajin, 흑아인","artist":"Ohyeon","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"7d3ef348-5f59-4e36-af8d-3095b9dd3a50","number":"169","chapter":"169","title":"SEASON 3 END","date":"2026-05-12","released":"2026-05-12"},{"chapter_id":"c7fc8f63-486f-442c-ab48-1640b36f6aa2","number":"168","chapter":"168","title":"","date":"2026-05-05","released":"2026-05-05"},{"chapter_id":"3635e715-d263-47ef-b31b-809ac0b376ef","number":"167","chapter":"167","title":"","date":"2026-04-28","released":"2026-04-28"},{"chapter_id":"a4d41b15-784a-4634-ae91-97f581af7e76","number":"166","chapter":"166","title":"","date":"2026-04-14","released":"2026-04-14"},{"chapter_id":"3157adfe-a878-4cc7-a730-e73ceef2a2dd","number":"165","chapter":"165","title":"","date":"2026-03-31","released":"2026-03-31"},{"chapter_id":"346baaa4-1472-47d7-ba56-cbfe37733e5c","number":"164","chapter":"164","title":"","date":"2026-03-24","released":"2026-03-24"},{"chapter_id":"94c28bb6-df8b-4729-8b75-4c5d863116fe","number":"163","chapter":"163","title":"","date":"2026-03-17","released":"2026-03-17"},{"chapter_id":"24075314-a656-49b0-85e6-7a134472a205","number":"162","chapter":"162","title":"","date":"2026-03-10","re